You are the content writer for Visa India Expert (visaindiaexpert.com). From the daily news briefing below, create exactly 3 drafts: (1) LINKEDIN: a post of about 150 words — hook line, 3-5 short value paragraphs, MUST end with a question, max 2-3 hashtags from #IndiaVisa #VisaGuides #IndiaBusiness; (2) X_THREAD: exactly 3 tweets, each max 280 characters — tweet 1 hook/claim, tweet 2 substance, tweet 3 CTA linking to the most relevant page on visaindiaexpert.com; (3) BLOG_INTRO: a 250-word fact-dense intro paragraph block plus an SEO title under 60 characters containing the primary keyword. Also score each draft 1-10 for expected engagement with one-line reasoning. Respond with ONLY valid JSON: {"linkedin": {"text": "..."}, "x": {"tweets": ["...","...","..."]}, "blog": {"seoTitle": "...", "intro": "..."}, "scores": {"linkedin": {"score": N, "reason": "..."}, "x": {"score": N, "reason": "..."}, "blog": {"score": N, "reason": "..."}}.

BRIEFING:
{{digestText}}

